        "text": {
            "description_html": "<b>Emtek 471224, Tuscany Entry Door Handleset with Covered Deadbolt</b>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nThe Cast Bronze Tuscany Two Piece Handleset features the floral  designs made popular by traditional Tuscan decor. This Tuscany Entry Door Handleset with Covered Deadbolt is available as a dummy function and a single cylinder function. It will fit either 2-3/8 inch or 2-3/4 inch backsets and can accommodate doors from 1-3/4 inches to 2-7/8 inches thick. Choose from either a flat black bronze finish or a medium bronze finish. \r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Features</b> for the Lost Wax Cast Bronze Tuscany Tubular Handleset:\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Keyway: Schlage C</li> \r\n<li>UL 180 minute fire rating</li>\r\n<li>Hardened steel bolt.</li>\r\n<li>Will fit standard 2-1/8\" door preparations.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Specifications</b> for the Emtek Tuscany Entrance Handleset with Covered Deadbolt:\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Material: Cast Bronze</li>\r\n<li>Exterior Deadbolt Height: 3-5/8\"</li>\r\n<li>Exterior Deadbolt Width: 2-1/2\"</li>\r\n<li>Exterior Top Plate Height: 4-1/2\"</li>\r\n<li>Exterior Top Plate Width: 3\"</li>\r\n<li>Exterior Bottom Mount Height: 3\"</li>\r\n<li>Exterior Bottom Mount Width: 1-13/16\"</li>\r\n<li>Exterior Projection: 3-9/32\"</li>\r\n<li>Exterior Grip Clearance: 2-3/8\"</li>\r\n<li>Exterior Grip Thickness: 1-9/16\"</li>\r\n<li>Interior Deadbolt Diameter: 2-1/2\"</li>\r\n<li>Interior Trim Plate Diameter: 2-5/8\"</li>\r\n<li>Door Thickness: 1-3/4\" - 2-7/8\" please specify</li>\r\n<li>Backset: either 2-3/8\" or 2-3/4\"</li>\r\n<li>Distance between Latch Bore to Bottom Mounting Hole: 9-7/16\" c.c.</li>\r\n<li><a href=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0766/1489/3857/files/EMT-470224-specifications.pdf?v=1704262357\"><b>Emtek 471224 Specifications (PDF)</b></a></li>\r\n\r\n<li><a href=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0766/1489/3857/files/EMT-Handle-C-Specifications.pdf?v=1704262297\"><b>Emtek Tubular Entryset Template Specifications (PDF)</b></a></li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>When Selecting a Function:</b>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li><b>Full Dummy Set:</b> Trim for non-working doors. It does not latch and does not lock. Usually used as matching trim for the non-working side of double doors.</li>\r\n<li><b>Single Cylinder:</b> From the exterior, a thumb piece operates the handleset latch and a key operates the deadbolt. From the inside, a thumbturn unlocks the deadbolt and a knob/lever operates the latch.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<i>Sold Individually</i>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<img src=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0766/1489/3857/files/EMT-lost-wax-finish.jpg?v=1704354555\" width=\"394\" height=\"189\" border=\"0\" alt=\"Emtek Finish Chart\">\r\n</p>",
